{
  "note": "The config of the look harness (tools/look/look.mjs). A selector is \"the hook, or the old selector\". idsMayGo and classesMayGo are the standing lists of the contract: a lost id or class of a list gives a warning only, and each other lost id or class fails. An entry of classesMayGo can end with *. The list changes is the register of the changes that rows ask for (ruling LOOK-EXACT). Each entry names its row, the full commit of the baseline that it was measured on, the pages it holds for (each page when it names none) and each change with its count; the header of look.mjs says what each key means. An entry holds only for a compare against the build of its baseline commit. Each entry of this file was measured on the build of 49d3ba0 (the state before Wave 2c). A change that no entry names fails, and a change that an entry names and that the page does not show fails too. In the pages drill and signals the step learnCards presses the control of each learn card of the Drill that shows (2c-plan C11, ruling LEARN-GAP); with no learn card it presses nothing. The page drill-learn shows the first screen of the Drill with no press: the learn card of job U1-D. The page yard names its text mirror (ruling LOOK-MIRROR): the mirror must be in the page, with one line for the engine and one line for each of the six tracks. A build job does not edit this file.",
